          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On June 4, 1977, around 11 AM, a witness and his son observed a small, dark point detaching from the clear sky. This point was stationary, and during the observation, several colored flashes were noticed. No noise was heard. No other testimony about this phenomenon was collected, for which we lack information.",
